meta {
  name: tag: flexserv (transformers)
  type: http
  seq: 29
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/pods/templates/flexserv/tags
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-Tapis-Token: {{X-Tapis-Token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "pod_definition": {
      "description": "FlexServ gateway + transformers backend (CPU pod variant). Serves Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B from a mounted models volume as an OpenAI-compatible /v1 endpoint on port 8000, behind tapis_auth. Models load from the tapisvolume mounted at /app/models (private repo layout: /app/models/private/<owner>/<model>).",
      "image": "zhangwei217245/flexserv-transformers:1.4.6",
      "command": ["/app/flexserv/bin/flexserv-gateway"],
      "arguments": [
        "--manage-backend",
        "--backend-kind", "transformers",
        "--backend-default-model", "FLEX:PRI:Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B",
        "--port", "8000",
        "--backend-port", "8001",
        "--backend-host", "0.0.0.0",
        "--backend-server", "/app/flexserv/backend/backend_server.py",
        "--flexserv-token", "",
        "--backend-device", "auto",
        "--backend-dtype", "bfloat16",
        "--backend-model-timeout", "86400",
        "--backend-quantization", "none",
        "--backend-attn-implementation", "sdpa"
      ],
      "secret_map": {
        "MODEL_NAME": "${pods:default:Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B:?Model id exposed via MODEL_NAME env (informational - the served default model is pinned in arguments; see docs)}"
      },
      "environment_variables": {
        "MODEL_REPO": "/app/models",
        "PRI_MODEL_REPO": "/app/models/private",
        "PUB_MODEL_REPO": "/app/models/public",
        "MODEL_NAME": "${pods:secrets:MODEL_NAME}",
        "FLEXSERV_PORT": "8000",
        "GATEWAY_BACKEND_PORT": "8001",
        "FLEXSERV_SECRET": ""
      },
      "volume_mounts": {
        "/app/models": {
          "type": "tapisvolume",
          "source_id": "${:?Tapis volume ID containing your models (layout: private/<user>/<model>, public/<model>)}",
          "read_only": false
        }
      },
      "networking": {
        "default": {
          "protocol": "http",
          "port": 8000,
          "tapis_auth": true,
          "tapis_auth_allowed_users": ["*"]
        }
      },
      "resources": {
        "cpu_request": 1000,
        "cpu_limit": 6000,
        "mem_request": 4096,
        "mem_limit": 16384
      },
      "time_to_stop_default": 86400
    },
    "tag": "transformers",
    "commit_message": "flexserv transformers CPU pod - gateway + backend, models tapisvolume prompt, tapis_auth on 8000",
    "description": "## FlexServ pod (transformers, CPU)\n\nOpenAI-compatible serving without the HPC queue: the FlexServ gateway manages a\ntransformers backend in the same pod and serves `/v1/chat/completions` on port 8000.\n\n### Deploy\n1. Create (or locate) a Tapis volume with your models: `private/<your-username>/<model>` or `public/<model>`.\n2. Deploy from this tag - the only required blank is that **models volume ID** (mounted at `/app/models`).\n3. Call it: `curl https://<pod>.pods.<tenant>/v1/chat/completions -H 'X-Tapis-Token: $JWT' -d '{\"model\": \"FLEX:PRI:Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B\", \"messages\": [...]}'`\n\n### Notes\n- Default served model is pinned in `arguments` (`FLEX:PRI:Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B`). Placeholders do not resolve inside `arguments`, so to serve a different model use **Create Pod From Tag** and edit `--backend-default-model` (and `MODEL_NAME`).\n- `tapis_auth: true` - callers pass their Tapis JWT (`X-Tapis-Token`); the gateway itself runs tokenless (`--flexserv-token \"\"`).\n- CPU-bound by design (bfloat16, sdpa attention) - fine for ~1B models; for bigger models use the FlexServ HPC job (FlexServ-Deployer).\n- `time_to_stop_default: 86400` (1 day); set -1 on the pod for always-on."
  }
}

docs {
  ## flexserv `transformers` - CPU pod variant

  The pod complement to the FlexServ HPC path (FlexServ-Deployer Tapis app + vLLM on
  GPU nodes). One container: flexserv-gateway supervises a transformers backend
  (`--manage-backend`), OpenAI-compatible API on 8000, backend on 8001.

  Blanks:
  - volume_mounts["/app/models"].source_id  (REQUIRED) - tapisvolume with the models
  - MODEL_NAME (optional, default Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B) - env only; the actually-served
    default model is pinned in arguments because placeholders don't resolve there.

  Derived from girishbdodda's working pod (image zhangwei217245/flexserv-transformers:1.4.6),
  with tapis_auth turned ON (original ran tapis_auth: false) and TTL 1 day (original -1).
}
